==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawn after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat (Enemy)|Yakisoba U.F.O. Cats]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

